# I&A project

Engine / Enforce / Enfusion: **`.cursor/rules/enfusion-enforce.mdc`**. Search `D:\ReforgerGameSources` before inventing APIs. Never edit GameSources.

- Prefix **`IA_`**. File name = class name. Classes/methods PascalCase; fields `m_` + type prefix (`m_s`, `m_v`, `m_i`, `m_b`, `m_f`); constants `UPPER_SNAKE`.
- New code goes under this addon's `Scripts/` (today mostly `Scripts/Game/`). Do not add I&A screens inside Mike's UI.
- Logging: `[IA][Subsystem]`. One `Print` per early return. `LogLevel.NORMAL` / `WARNING` / `ERROR`.
- UI: `.cursor/rules/mikes-ui.mdc`. Pause menu stays vanilla.
